    AUTO SERVER HOP SCRIPT v12 (Anti-Broken Server + AFK Detector)
    - v11: Highest = >=5 free slots; Lowest = emptiest across scan; Force = first joinable.
    - v12: + Post-join AFK/broken-server validation. Hops out of dead servers
             (majority-AFK, round-started-empty) regardless of population mode.
    - v12: + Skips servers reporting <2 real players during Highest scan.
    - v12: + UI toggle for AFK Watch.
]]

